:: Tavern Rest
<<if $gold >= 5>>
<<set $hp to $max_hp>>
<<set $gold -= 5>>

You spend 5 gold for a room and meal. The bed is rough but warm. By morning, your wounds are healed.

''HP restored to $max_hp.'' Gold remaining: $gold.

[[Leave the tavern|Town Square]]
<<else>>
You don't have enough gold for a room. Berta shakes her head. "No credit, friend."

